  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Không gian mẫu <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Ω</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∣</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi>i</mi><mo>≠</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, trong đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> kí hiệu kết quả Tùng chọn được quả bóng ghi số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>i</mi></semantics></math>, Cúc chọn được quả bóng ghi số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>j</mi></semantics></math>.</li><li>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>:</mo></mrow></semantics></math>““ Tổng hai số ghi trên hai quả bóng lấy ra bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>10</mn></semantics></math>”” . <br>Ta có\n\t\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo>